1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,590
Zombies. On my farm.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:07,060
I woke up to screaming, looked outside,
and saw my neighbor chasing the mailman.

3
00:00:07,330 --> 00:00:08,420
On all fours.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,580
So I did the smartest thing possible.

5
00:00:10,750 --> 00:00:13,690
I locked the doors… and made breakfast.

6
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:19,950
I mean, it's a farm. We have food,
space, and a well.

7
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,190
What could go wrong?

8
00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:22,950
Then the lights died.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,800
And with them, our electric well pump.

10
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:31,100
Fun fact: during a real emergency, clean
water becomes a priority fast.

11
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:34,250
A farm doesn't magically make you
self-sufficient.

12
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,630
Okay. Fine. I'll be quiet and figure
this out.

13
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:42,900
That's when our rooster decided it was
sunrise. Again.

14
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,140
The zombies outside stopped.

15
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:46,410
Slowly turned.

16
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:50,080
Great. My security system has feathers.

17
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,340
I ran to shut the window.

18
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:56,630
Then I heard footsteps… inside the
house.

19
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,620
The back door was open.

20
00:00:59,090 --> 00:01:00,410
But I locked that door.
